      "id": "s0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The mode for uploading compliance items. You can specify [[p0]] or [[p1]] . In [[p2]] mode, the system overwrites all existing compliance information for the resource. You must provide a full list of compliance items each time you send the request.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "COMPLETE"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "PARTIAL"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "COMPLETE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "In [[p0]] mode, the system overwrites compliance information for a specific association. The association must be configured with [[p1]] set to [[p2]] . By default, all requests use [[p3]] mode.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "PARTIAL"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "SyncCompliance"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "MANUAL"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "COMPLETE"
        }
      ]
    },
